      <activity id="1bac00f6-0a79-5f71-b406-006cacbf527d" activityNameId="16988b13-5cb9-5763-9931-e3264ba89e31" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Network access devices, internet, at user</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Network access devices, internet, at user
The data set represents the material in internet access devices, based on assumptions for the chassis and PWB. The dataset has been checked with the recent literature information and require no updates in 2023, except for the recent electronics dataset used in the inventory; UUID: 97735c90-09ed-330d-8c97-220b8a5e1b6c
This data set includes all network access devices usually required for internet communication. It namely includes: ADSL modem with router, DSLAM and connecting cables. Manufacture and transport included.
Location: Data for Swiss conditions
Technology: Included devices: ADSL modem with router and DSLAM, DSLAM with 17 line cards with 48 ports. 50% capacity utilisation.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: unknown
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_97735c90-09ed-330d-8c97-220b8a5e1b6c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
